# Finance and documents

- Monetary values use decimal/numeric semantics, never JS floating-point as source of truth.
- Payments, charges and session-to-charge generation are idempotent.
- Cancellation/voiding should preserve audit history; avoid destructive deletes for financial facts.
- Final documents are versioned and immutable; new edits create versions.
- PDFs/attachments live in private Supabase Storage with sha256 metadata.
- Signed download links are short-lived.

- Secretary finance permissions are enforced server-side/RLS from `practice_settings.secretary_finance_access`: none=no access, view=SELECT only, manage=SELECT/INSERT/UPDATE operational.
- Hard DELETE of financial facts is denied by default for all roles; use void/cancel/reversal states with audit.
